{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/ACZYJv6Ztgo1QVE6DguJJA","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:23.235574+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/ACZYJv6Ztgo1QVE6DguJJA","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><section></section><section></section><section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>1</span></strong></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><span><strong><span>环境学院简介</span></strong></span></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>国科大杭州高等研究院创立于</span></span><span><span> 2019 </span></span><span><span>年，由中国科学院大学（简称“国科大”）和杭州市人民政府合作共建的一所高起点、小而精的教学科研机构，也是中国科学院大学的直属二级学院、杭州市直属正局级事业单位。</span></span></p><p><span><span>环境学院是隶属于国科大杭州高等研究院的二级学院，由我国著名分析化学家、环境化学家江桂斌院士创建并担任院长，原环境化学与环境毒理全国重点实验室常务副主任郑明辉教授担任执行院长。环境学院由中国科学院生态环境研究中心环境化学与环境毒理全国重点实验室参与承办，建有全省新污染物环境与健康重点实验室，下设</span></span><span><span>11</span></span><span><span>个教授工作室及非靶标分析中心、环境样品库、二恶英实验室等平台。同时，中国分析测试协会新污染物专业委员会挂靠环境学院，还是中国分析测试协会培训基地和资质考核中心。</span></span></p><p><span><span>学院面向环境污染与健康的国际前沿</span></span><span><span>,</span></span><span><span>面向区域性环境污染控制的国家重大需求</span></span><span><span>, </span></span><span><span>承担应用基础研究、专业人才培养和科技成果转化的三大任务。学院规划面积约两万多平米，已投入使用</span></span><span><span>8000</span></span><span><span>平米，已建成具备超</span></span><span><span>1.3</span></span><span><span>亿元先进仪器设备的综合性实验室平台。环境学院聚焦新污染物，力争在新污染物的筛选识别、毒理与人群健康和污染控制与健康保障技术三大方向上取得重大突破，推动我国环境化学与毒理学学科发展，</span></span><span><span>同时在支撑国家履行斯德哥尔摩公约和水俣公约等方面发挥重要作用。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>2</span></strong></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><span><strong><span>师资力量</span></strong></span></section></section><section><strong><span><span>王叁</span></span></strong></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>学院师资力量雄厚，学院现有</span></span><span><span>78</span></span><span><span>名教职工（全职</span></span><span><span>45</span></span><span><span>名，双聘</span></span><span><span>33</span></span><span><span>名），包括中国科学院院士</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>人，国家级领军人才</span></span><span><span>14</span></span><span><span>人、国家级青年人才</span></span><span><span>15</span></span><span><span>人、浙江省级人才</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>人；以第一完成人身份三次获得国家自然科学二等奖，一次国家科学技术进步二等奖。</span></span><span><span>11</span></span><span><span>个教授工作室首席教授均为环境科学与健康相关领域内知名学者。</span></span></p><p><span><span>学院教授工作室聚焦学科前沿、极具发展前景：</span></span></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/SWZT5eHHhhwThicrljSaNTgaUrRY7dzEia45PAyl3t6h3LRIInYcHjOXcbKxreB0vlgaWhHWZf5ibIGmu5IAcXwWicE4VfGNvyG7Z0HbnDS7O3k/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><span>更多导师信息详见</span></span><span><span>http://hias.ucas.ac.cn/hjxy/ssdw1/yszj.htm</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>3</span></strong></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><span><strong><span>招生专业</span></strong></span></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>欢迎具有环境、生物、化学、毒理、公共卫生与健康等相关专业背景，或其他有志于从事环境事业的理工科学生报考！</span></span></p><p><span><span>学硕：</span></span><span><span>083001</span></span><span><span>环境科学（依托中国科学院生态环境研究中心）</span></span></p><p><span><span>专硕：</span></span><span><span>085701</span></span><span><span>环境工程（国科大杭州高等研究院独立招生）</span></span></p><p><span><span>备注：以上仅供参考，最终推免招生专业以正式发布的</span></span><span><span>2027</span></span><span><span>年招生目录为准</span></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>4</span></strong></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><span><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></span></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>凡在高等院校获得推荐免试资格的优秀应届本科毕业生均可申请推荐免试攻读杭高院（国科大学籍）环境学院研究生。申请者应具备如下条件：</span></span></p><p><span><span>1．</span></span><span><span>须获得推免资格且已在（或将在）教育部“推免服务系统”中备案。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2．</span></span><span><span>热爱科学事业，有较好的科研潜力，道德品质良好，遵纪守法。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3．</span></span><span><span>诚实守信，学风优良，无任何考试作弊和剽窃他人学术成果记录，无任何违法违纪受处分记录。</span></span></p><p><span><span>4．</span></span><span><span>本科阶段成绩优异，在学期间所学专业主干课无重修科目或补考记录。</span></span></p><p><span><span>5．</span></span><span><span>外语程度良好，具有较强的外语听、说、读、写应用能力。</span></span></p><p><span><span>6．</span></span><span><span>具有较强的调查研究、综合分析问题、解决问题能力。</span></span></p><p><span><span>7．</span></span><span><span>身体健康状况符合规定的体检标准，心理健康状况良好。</span></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>5</span></strong></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><span><strong><span>申请时间</span></strong></span></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>即日起至</span></span><strong><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span>15</span></span><span><span><span><span>日（周二）</span></span></span></span><span><span>24：00</span></span></strong></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>6</span></strong></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><span><strong><span>申请流程</span></strong></span></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span><span>1、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>所</span></span><span><span>有申请人需完成问卷星报名并提交申请材料才视为报名成功：</span></span></strong></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/SWZT5eHHhhzybR2HsX4N3myRqePvLgZeIBqicBOia6zzSD6SyNd0iaW8nvstHEaHkMMOpRic3g68jFdnw7rds5lPk8KZGk3fD49Pia3LICgjgurc/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><span><span>https://v.wjx.cn/vm/rXY4JJL.aspx#</span></span><span> </span></span></p><p><span><span>注：建议在电脑上操作填写</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>2、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>若为</span></span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span>年环境学院暑期夏令营优秀营员，</span></span></strong><span><span>填完本问卷并提交政审材料至学院邮箱即视为报名成功，无需重复提交申请材料。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>、申请材料：</span></span></p><p><span><span>申请人应将以下材料按顺序整理成</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>个</span></span><span><span>PDF</span></span><span><span>格式文档（以“</span></span><span><span>27</span></span><span><span>推免</span></span><span><span>-</span></span><span><span>学校</span></span><span><span>-</span></span><span><span>姓名”命名），于</span></span><strong><span><span>9</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>月</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>15</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>日（周二）</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>24</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>：</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>00</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>前发送至环境学院邮箱：</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>hjxy@ucas.ac.cn</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>。</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>必要材料：</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>）《中国科学院大学接收推荐免试研究生申请表》（具体格式见</span></span><strong><span><span>附件</span></span><span><span>1</span></span></strong><span><span>，不要更改表格形式）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>所在学校教务部门（或院系）出具并加盖公章的大学本科前</span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>年所修课程成绩单（</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>年制的提供前</span></span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>年课程成绩单）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>）大学英语四、六级成绩、</span></span><span><span>TOEFL</span></span><span><span>或</span></span><span><span>GRE</span></span><span><span>成绩等体现自身英语水平的证明材料复印件；</span></span></p><p><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>）学生证、身份证复印件（正反面复印）、</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>寸正身免冠照片；</span></span></p><p><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>）政审材料，须加盖公章（由所在学校（学院）出具，格式见附件</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>）。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>选交材料：</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>）专家推荐书；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>）在公开发行的学术刊物或全国性学术会议上发表的学术论文、所获专利或其它原创性工作成果的复印件或证明；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>）大学期间的获奖证书复印件。</span></span></p><p><span><span>注：本次申请只需提交电子版材料，无需寄送纸质版，需要签字的材料请打印下来手签后扫描上传。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>7</span></strong></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><span><strong><span>学院考核</span></strong></span></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>、学院对接收到的申请材料进</span></span><span><span>行初</span></span><span><span>审，并通过邮件或其他方式向初审合格者发送复试通知，未通过初审者不再另行通知。复试考核内容主要包括思想政治品德考核、专业知识和外语水平的考核。</span></span><span><span>复试具体安排后续通知，请考生留意学院官网、个人邮箱和移动电话。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>、学院对考核结果进行审议，按照“德智体全面衡量、择优录取、保证质量、宁缺毋滥”的原则确定拟录取名单并进行公示。对考生的拟录取以教育部“推免服务系统”中发送的“待录取通知”为准。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>8</span></strong></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><span><strong><span>后续流程</span></strong></span></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>（一）</span></span></strong></span><strong><span><span>完成</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>教育</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>部推免服务系统中录取操作</span></span></strong><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><span>通过复试并获得拟录取资格的考生请务必于系统关闭前登录教育部全国推荐优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生信息公开暨管理服务系统”（网址</span></span><span><span>:http://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm</span></span><span><span>）完成网上录取操作。具体流程如下：</span></span></p><p><span><span>在教育部“推免服务系统”（网址</span></span><span><span>:http://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm</span></span><span><span>）中选择</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>中国科学院大学</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>（学校代码：</span></span><span><span>14430</span></span><span><span>），再选择院系</span></span><span><span>（专硕选择</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>杭州高等研究院</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>（院系代码：</span></span><span><span>216</span></span><span><span>），专业方向选择“环境工程”，学硕选择“生态环境研究中心”（院系代码：</span></span><span><span>042</span></span><span><span>），专业方向选择“环境科学</span></span><span><span>-</span></span><span><span>为国科大杭高院代招”）</span></span><span><span>，完成填写报考志愿、接收并确认复试及接收录取通知操作。</span></span></p><p><span><span>所有推免生均须通过教育部“推免服务系统”填写报考志愿、电子照片上传、网上缴费、接收并确认复试及待录取通知。对考生的拟录取以教育部“推免服务系统”中发送的“待录取通知”为准。</span></span></p><p><span><span>已备案录取的推免生不得再以统考生身份报名参加全国硕士生统一入学考试。</span></span><span><span>2027</span></span><span><span>年推免生不再参加硕士研究生网报现场确认。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>（二）体检和政审</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>拟录取后组织进行。体检在二级甲等及以上医院进行，体检报告须有考生本人近期免冠彩色照片，照片和体检表上加盖体检医院骑缝章。体检参照教育部、卫生部、中国残联制订的《普通高等学校招生体检工作指导意见》（教学</span></span><span><span>[2003]3</span></span><span><span>号）文件和教育部办公厅、卫生部办公厅《关于普通高等学校招生学生入学身体检查取消乙肝项目检测有关问题的通知》（教学厅</span></span><span><span>[2010]2</span></span><span><span>号）执行。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>（三）录取资格复核及录取通知书发放</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>对拟录取的推荐免试生，将与拟录取的统考生一起上报教育部审核，审核通过后与统考生同时发放录取通知书。</span></span></p><p><span><span>在发放录取通知书之前，对接收的推免生近期学习情况进行审查。对拟录取的推免生，出现下列情况之一的，取消其录取资格：</span></span></p><p><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>、在本科阶段最后一学年（四年制的指第七、八学期，五年制的指第九、十学期）学习成绩有不及格科目；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>、毕业设计（论文）未取得良好及以上成绩；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>、毕业时未获得本科毕业证书或学士学位；</span></span></p><p><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>、政审不合格；</span></span></p><p><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>、考试作弊者或违纪（法）受到</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>警告</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>以上处分的，或有其他情节严重的违法乱纪行为受到处罚者；</span></span></p><p><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>、申请人提交的材料有弄虚作假者；</span></span></p><p><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>、对拟录取的推荐免试生，若最后未获得其所在高校的推荐免试名额，拟录取资格自动失效。</span></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>9</span></strong></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><span><strong><span>其他事项说明</span></strong></span></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>、若有任何疑问请致电</span></span><span><span>0571-86080596</span></span><span><span>或邮件</span></span><span><span>hjxy@ucas.ac.cn</span></span><span><span>咨询招生负责老师。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>、如该公告内容与上级最新政策不符，以上级最新政策为准。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>、了解「国科大杭州高等研究院」，请访问</span></span><span><span>http://hias.ucas.ac.cn/</span></span></p><p><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>、了解「环境学院」，请访问</span></span><span><span>http://hias.ucas.ac.cn/hjxy</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>国科大杭高院环境学院</span></span></p><p><span><span>2026年9月1日</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/ACZYJv6Ztgo1QVE6DguJJA\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>附件1：《中国科学院大学接收推荐免试研究生申请表》.docx</span></a></span></p><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/ACZYJv6Ztgo1QVE6DguJJA\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>附件2：《国科大杭州高等研究院推荐免试生政审表》.doc</span></a></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/ACZYJv6Ztgo1QVE6DguJJA\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件1：《中国科学院大学接收推荐免试研究生申请表》.docx附件1：《中国科学院大学接收推荐免试研究生申请表》.docx附件1：《中国科学院大学接收推荐免试研究生申请表》.docx附件1：《中国科学院大学接收推荐免试研究生申请表》.docx附件1：《中国科学院大学接收推荐免试研究生申请表》.docx</a></span></p></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"8aba777c2bc9636a45dfa7ac5b7b30bdf9f21d89a4f0b9eb3e7e1575af9ee925","textLength":3382,"sourceSha256":"ab21e5890dd6dded0a5c9a534a98b7721d12423886acb1c4730b75fbf46a8eac","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-b168d465b6ce978894f8","title":"2026年中国科学院大学杭州高等研究院环境学院接收2027年推荐免试硕士研究生公告","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:23.235574+00:00"}
